870fd05bc7b1456e14e11cb69.webm?t=1677892403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220200/extras/b52eff6870fd05bc7b1456e14e11cb69.mp4?t=1677892403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>360 Mode</strong></h2>The most friendly and weird game mode. Here your Rubber Duck will be rotating all the time and you need to move and shoot at the right timing to hit your friend. You can also throw grenades, parry and use specials. Seems simple but let me see how you handle this game when both players are on Hit Kill.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220200/extras/220f35d8a603632b585d9ac3f0678bfd.poster.avif?t=1677892403\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220200/extras/220f35d8a603632b585d9ac3f0678bfd.webm?t=1677892403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220200/extras/220f35d8a603632b585d9ac3f0678bfd.mp4?t=1677892403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize your Rubber Duckies</strong></h2>More than 30 Hats for you customize. Playing with your style sure creates a nice feeling of personality and can easily distinguish you from others friends on a Championship for example. Go Silly or go with a Historic Helmet.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220200/extras/e2ade78df98f01234e89abca4b468d83.poster.avif?t=1677892403\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220200/extras/e2ade78df98f01234e89abca4b468d83.webm?t=1677892403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220200/extras/e2ade78df98f01234e89abca4b468d83.mp4?t=1677892403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
